*> Contract probe (make gate-contract, T077): copies every contract copybook and asserts the length
*> of each record and the values of the constants the contracts state. Test infrastructure.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. PROBE-CONTRACT.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY CCSHIM.
 COPY PROTO.
 COPY COREAPI.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 01 WS-INT-BYTES           PIC X(4).
 01 WS-INT-VALUE REDEFINES WS-INT-BYTES BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
*> Record lengths: shim-abi.md §8, §9.
     MOVE "contract CCSHIM CC-EVENT length" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 24 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(CC-EVENT) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract CCSHIM CC-VERTEX length" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 28 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(CC-VERTEX) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract CCSHIM CC-EVENT-SIZE equals CC-EVENT length" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE CC-EVENT-SIZE TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(CC-EVENT) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract CCSHIM CC-VERTEX-SIZE equals CC-VERTEX length" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE CC-VERTEX-SIZE TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(CC-VERTEX) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
*> BINARY-LONG is native little-endian, as the C side of the event record expects (§8).
     MOVE 1 TO WS-INT-VALUE
     MOVE "contract CCSHIM BINARY-LONG is little-endian" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "01000000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     MOVE FUNCTION HEX-OF(WS-INT-BYTES) TO TL-OBSERVED
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
*> Constants: shim-abi.md §3 to §9.
     MOVE "contract CCSHIM outcome constants" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1234567 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = CC-AGAIN * 1000000 + CC-ADDR-IN-USE * 100000 + CC-UNRESOLVED * 10000
         + CC-CLOSED * 1000 + CC-SMALL * 100 + CC-BADDATA * 10 + CC-NOTFOUND
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract CCSHIM zlib modes" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 12 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = CC-ZLIB * 100 + CC-GZIP * 10 + CC-RAW
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract CCSHIM pipelines" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 12 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = CC-PIPE-OPAQUE * 100 + CC-PIPE-TRANSLUCENT * 10 + CC-PIPE-UI
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract CCSHIM texture ids" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 123 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = CC-TEX-BLOCKS * 1000 + CC-TEX-ENTITIES * 100 + CC-TEX-UI * 10
         + CC-TEX-ENVIRONMENT
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract CCSHIM texture wrap modes" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = CC-WRAP-CLAMP * 10 + CC-WRAP-REPEAT
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract CCSHIM event kinds" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 123456789 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = CC-EV-KEY-DOWN * 100000000 + CC-EV-KEY-UP * 10000000
         + CC-EV-TEXT * 1000000 + CC-EV-BUTTON-DOWN * 100000 + CC-EV-BUTTON-UP * 10000
         + CC-EV-CURSOR * 1000 + CC-EV-SCROLL * 100 + CC-EV-RESIZE * 10 + CC-EV-CLOSE-REQUEST
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
*> Record lengths: proto-api.md §1 and §2 (PROTO.cpy).
