     MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(PB-METADATA-ENTRY) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract PROTO PB-SLOT-DISPLAY length" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 12 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(PB-SLOT-DISPLAY) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract PROTO PB-RECIPE-DISPLAY length" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 201 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
