*> Record lengths and constants: core-host-api.md §1 (COREAPI.cpy).
     MOVE "contract COREAPI CORE-SETTINGS length" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1707 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(CORE-SETTINGS) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract COREAPI CORE-BUFFER length" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 16 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(CORE-BUFFER) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract COREAPI CORE-STATUS length" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 5 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE FUNCTION LENGTH(CORE-STATUS) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     MOVE "contract COREAPI connection kinds" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     COMPUTE TL-OBSERVED-N = CORE-CONN-NETWORK * 10 + CORE-CONN-MEMORY
     PERFORM ASSERT-NUMBER
     STOP RUN.

 ASSERT-NUMBER.
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
